{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id988265411"}, "name":{"label":"Reuben Phillips"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-02-14T10:41:11-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.3.6"}, "id":{"label":"9617663436"}, "title":{"label":"So helpful"}, "content":{"label":"This app has saved me so much time and helped break my habit of being late. Do I want to wait 3 seconds to open Instagram, or do I wanna continue getting ready to leave? It’s such a simple app but it’s such good value, highly recommended", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id443705393"}, "name":{"label":"jfal064"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-02-08T01:58:45-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.1.1"}, "id":{"label":"9595509665"}, "title":{"label":"Can't seem to close app"}, "content":{"label":"I love this app on my iPhone but unfortunately having a lot of trouble with the MacOS app. It gets stuck on the restore purchase window for one sec pro and doesn't allow me to close the window which means I cannot quit out of the app.  Would really appreciate a permanent fix for this! I see it's been quite a persistent bug in previous updates...", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/reviews/id454889022"}, "name":{"label":"primehylian"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2023-02-04T16:48:55-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"3.3.6"}, "id":{"label":"9584017501"}, "title":{"label":"Incredible"}, "content":{"label":"I tried this app out on a whim and now all my friends use it too. Sick of being chronically online and this app helped break a lot of habits. Delaying instead of preventing is far more effective since it just makes opening twitter, reddit, or instagram that much more inconvenient. I bought a year of the full version and haven’t looked back. My screen time over the past 3 weeks has plummeted.\n\nI would appreciate a bit more customization with some apps outside of social media. Like preventing me opening Slack outside of work hours, or similar. But as it is, this app is still very effective and packs a whole lot of features, and the price is extremely affordable. I’m sick of apps which offer wellbeing improvements charging an arm and a leg, and this app is a breath of fresh air.\n\nI wish their web browser extension for PC had a few more features, but thats a minor nitpick. \n\nIncredible app, incredible value.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/nz/review?id=1532875441&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"1"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"1"}}, 
